	(text "BATTERY PACK ON PCB: MODULAR 16S / 14S BREAKOUT & TRAINING BOARD\n========================================================================\n• Form Factor: True A4 Landscape (297 mm x 210 mm)\n• Power Stackup: 4-Layer Symmetrical Heavy Copper (2oz Top, 1oz Inner 1, 1oz Inner 2, 2oz Bottom)\n• Safety Standard: IEC 62368-1 SELV (<=60V DC default lab rating with 14S; 16S under acrylic cover)\n• Sensing: 4-Wire True Kelvin Voltage Sense Taps & 8x Dual-Can Saddle NTC Thermistors\n• Active Safety: Zero-Drain Reverse Polarity Triads, 1500A High-Breaking Ceramic Fuse, 70V TVS Clamping"
